sequenceDiagram
    participant DRV as XSpace Driver
    participant CMD as Command Parser
    participant LIFE as Lifecycle Manager
    participant SDKB as SDK Bridge
    participant SDK as claude_agent_sdk
    participant ENT as Entrypoint

    alt 显式 shutdown
        DRV->>CMD: stdin: shutdown{threadId, reason?}
        CMD->>LIFE: dispatch shutdown
    else stdin EOF
        DRV-->>CMD: stdin closed
        CMD->>LIFE: dispatch shutdown(reason=stdin_closed)
    end

    Note over LIFE: 如果有进行中 run，先 interrupt
    LIFE->>SDKB: client.disconnect()
    SDKB->>SDK: terminate
    SDK-->>SDKB: ok
    LIFE->>ENT: exit code 0
    ENT->>ENT: 进程退出
